From 7fe0314f32543ddf5acbfd231a6e7cee726afb04 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ReArc Overlay <overlay@rearc.invalid>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 09:53:08 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] P-TAB-001 wave 18c: surface Chromium permission requests
 without browser UI

Attach PermissionRequestManager and provide a host PermissionPrompt through ChromePermissionsClient. Route camera/microphone delegates through MediaCaptureDevicesDispatcher; keep screen capture unsupported. Carry an explicit persistence choice through PermissionPromptDecision, including duplicate requests, so PermissionContextBase can resolve without storing. Suppress embedded follow-up infobars/surveys. ABI 1.20 / bridge 0.22.0; builds p57-p59 and native permission host cover notifications, clipboard, MIDI, grouped camera/microphone, geolocation, persistence and cancellation. Wave 16 shutdown traits unchanged.

Last rebased: 2026-11-04 onto Chromium 156.0.8078.74 (d331de35ca).

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
